ISO 14001 normative requirements:
{{ clause_requirements }}

Candidate evidence chunks:
{{ evidence_chunks }}

Required output schema:
{
  "relevant_indices": [<1-based Chunk numbers judged relevant to this clause>]
}

Output ONLY valid JSON. No prose, no markdown fences.
